      "shippingContent": "We ship within Switzerland. Delivery times are estimates only and are not guaranteed. Risk of loss transfers to the customer upon handover to the shipping carrier. Shipping costs are displayed at checkout.",
      "returnsTitle": "Returns & Refunds",
      "returnsContent": "You may return unused products within 14 days of receipt. Products must be in original packaging and undamaged condition. Refunds are processed within 14 business days after we receive the returned item. Shipping costs for returns are borne by the customer.",
