      "lastUpdated": "Last updated: February 2026",
      "introTitle": "Introduction",
      "introContent": "We take the protection of your personal data seriously. This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights under applicable data protection laws including the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP) and the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).",
      "dataCollectedTitle": "Data We Collect",
      "dataCollectedContent": "We collect the following personal data: name, email address, shipping address, and payment information (processed securely by Stripe). We also collect technical data such as IP addresses, browser type, and device information for security and analytics purposes.",
      "purposeTitle": "Purpose of Processing",
      "purposeContent": "Your data is processed for the following purposes: order processing and fulfillment, payment processing, customer communication, fraud prevention, and service improvement. We process data based on contractual necessity and legitimate interests.",
      "thirdPartiesTitle": "Third-Party Services",
      "thirdPartiesContent": "We use the following third-party services: Stripe (payment processing), Clerk (authentication), Vercel (hosting and infrastructure), Sentry (error monitoring), and Resend (transactional emails). Each provider processes data according to their own privacy policy.",
      "cookiesTitle": "Cookies",
      "cookiesContent": "We use essential cookies required for the functioning of the shop (session management, cart, authentication). Analytics cookies are only used with your explicit consent. You can manage your cookie preferences at any time via the cookie settings in the footer.",
